      "content": "i've tried the professionals. it doesn't work. they just give you more things to \"manage\" and \"cope\" with, but they dont actually make the noise go away. it's like they're trying to fix a broken radio when the only way to get silence is to just unplug the whole thing. i just want to know if there's any way to actually find peace. real, absolute peace where nothing can reach me.",
